Question three, where it spawns.

1196
01:48:28,046 --> 01:48:29,796
它应该在你瞄准的地方生成吗？
Should it spawn where you're aiming?

1197
01:48:30,446 --> 01:48:34,692
它应该在玩家放置它的瞬间立即生成，而不是作为全息图。
It should spawn immediately as a player places them down and not as a hologram.

1198
01:48:35,118 --> 01:48:36,880
胶状生物不会是全息图。
The blob will not be a hologram.

1199
01:48:36,960 --> 01:48:38,720
胶状生物应该直接被放置下来。
The blob should just be placed down immediately.

1200
01:48:38,880 --> 01:48:41,252
在那里等待直到它看到敌方胶状生物。
Wait there until it sees the enemy blobs.

1201
01:48:42,190 --> 01:48:43,280
如何分辨它。
How to tell it apart.

1202
01:48:43,440 --> 01:48:46,532
友好粘液应该有一个固定的、独特的外观吗？
Should the friendly blob have one fixed, distinctive look?

1203
01:48:46,798 --> 01:48:51,716
例如，发光的青色或白色，绝不是敌方生物，而是随机的糖果色。
For example, glowing cyan or white, never one of the enemies, random candy colors.

1204
01:48:51,950 --> 01:48:53,860
这样你就能在人群中一眼认出它。
So you could read it at a glance in a crowd.

1205
01:48:54,542 --> 01:49:00,644
是的，我想要友好粘液是绿色的，而且是饱和的绿色。
Yes, I want the friendly blobs to be green and a saturated green.

1206
01:49:01,070 --> 01:49:03,396
所以把那个颜色留给友好粘液。
So reserve that color for the friendly blobs.

1207
01:49:04,206 --> 01:49:04,960
队友伤害。
Friendly fire.

1208
01:49:05,040 --> 01:49:10,052
目前，每个炮塔都会攻击每一个胶状生物，手榴弹和你的步枪也会伤害任何胶状生物。
Right now, every turret targets every blob and grenades and your rifle hurt any blob.

1209
01:49:10,320 --> 01:49:12,740
友好粘液应该受到完全保护吗？
Should friendly blobs be fully protected?

1210
01:49:13,360 --> 01:49:13,680
不。
No.

1211
01:49:14,638 --> 01:49:16,804
不，友好粘液不能挡路。
No friendly blobs can get in the way.

1212
01:49:17,230 --> 01:49:18,788
它们可能会被击中并被杀死。
They could get shot and killed.

1213
01:49:19,534 --> 01:49:20,960
波次和现金。
Waves and cash.

1214
01:49:21,230 --> 01:49:24,160
友好粘液应该完全排除在波次之外吗？
Should friendly blobs be left out of the wave entirely?

1215
01:49:24,320 --> 01:49:27,280
这意味着它们不计入剩余的胶状生物数量中。
That means they don't count towards blobs remaining.

1216
01:49:27,360 --> 01:49:29,540
是的，是的，它们应该立即被排除。
Yes, yes, they should be left out immediately.

1217
01:49:30,382 --> 01:49:34,640
设置存放在哪里，是的，这能保持你的单 Actor 全控制设置。
Where the settings live, yes, that keeps your one actor full control setup.

1218
01:49:34,800 --> 01:49:36,804
它应该在波次设置里。
It should be within the wave settings.

1219
01:49:37,166 --> 01:49:39,588
注意看我是怎么把那个关掉的。
Notice how for I'm set that off.

1220
01:49:40,206 --> 01:49:45,340
注意看对于所有问题，它还会给你提供一个推荐答案。
Notice how for all the questions, it also gives you a recommended answer to.

1221
01:49:47,662 --> 01:49:52,720
现在，我回答这些问题的方式，就是像平时一样说话。
Now, the way I was answering these questions, I was just talking like normal.

1222
01:49:52,974 --> 01:49:55,920
虽然你也可以逐一回答，非常直接。
Although you could go through each one and be very direct.

1223
01:49:56,080 --> 01:50:03,972
如果你想简短点，就只做 Q1 是，Q2 否，以此类推。
Just do Q1, yes, Q2, no, and and so on, if you want to be shorter.

1224
01:50:04,878 --> 01:50:10,692
这个技能的工作原理是，它强制你和 AI 进行对话，问题是按轮次进行的。
The way this skill works is that it forces a conversation between you and the AI, and the questions go in rounds.

1225
01:50:10,960 --> 01:50:15,972
所以，我们刚刚回答的这第一轮问题是主要的、最重要的问题。
So, the first questions right here that we just answered are the main, most important questions.

1226
01:50:16,238 --> 01:50:28,324
然后它会要求进行第二轮，也就是一些较小的问题，或者它可能会有一些后续问题，
要求你在下一轮中更详细地解释你的决定。
and then it will ask for a second round, the smaller questions, or it might have some
follow-up questions where you have to explain your decision more within the next round.

1227
01:50:28,560 --> 01:50:35,120
它会不断提问，直到 AI 觉得它掌握了足够多的关于该功能的信息为止。
and it will keep on asking more and more questions until the AI feels like it has enough information about the feature.

1228
01:50:35,280 --> 01:50:36,740
然后它就会去实现它。
and then it will implement it.

1229
01:50:37,120 --> 01:50:54,240
这也很棒，因为它能帮助你作为游戏开发者去思考特定功能的后果，
因为也许你之前没考虑到 HUD 的控制键是什么，或者胶状生物是否应该跑得更快。
This is also good because it helps you as the game developer think through the ramifications of a specific feature because maybe you
didn't think to yourself what the controls of the HUD would be, or whether or not the blobs should be faster.

1230
01:50:54,606 --> 01:50:59,876
所以，那些追逐敌方胶状生物的胶状生物应该是跑得更快，还是速度一样？
So the blobs that are chasing the enemy blobs should be faster or should be the same speed.

1231
01:51:00,206 --> 01:51:01,440
所以这些现在全都是问题。
So these are all questions now.

1232
01:51:01,520 --> 01:51:07,040
AI 在反馈，就像你正在进行真正的对话，来真正对齐你的目标。
The AI is getting back, and it's like you're having an actual conversation to really align your goals.

1233
01:51:07,200 --> 01:51:12,240
这样 AI 生成的内容就能尽可能接近你的想法。
That's how what the AI produces is as close as possible to what you were thinking.

1234
01:51:12,526 --> 01:51:17,840
现在，在我的情况下，我要结束这个「审问我」环节，因为我不想经历好几轮。
Now, in my case, I will end the grill me because I don't want to go through a couple different rounds.

1235
01:51:18,000 --> 01:51:19,332
我觉得现在这样就可以了。
I think this is good for now.

1236
01:51:20,558 --> 01:51:22,404
全部选是，然后结束审问。
Yes to everything, and the grill me.

1237
01:51:22,560 --> 01:51:23,748
就按这个来。
Just work on this.

1238
01:51:25,038 --> 01:51:26,512
我们回来了。
