我想做两个修改。
I do want to make two changes.

1271
01:53:03,182 --> 01:53:09,952
与其一个个单独写提示词，我可以直接把我想做的所有不同修改列给 AI。
And instead of prompting each one individually, I could just list out to the AI a bunch of different changes that I want to do.

1272
01:53:10,032 --> 01:53:11,364
然后它们就可以一次性全部搞定。
And then they could do it all at once.

1273
01:53:11,598 --> 01:53:15,140
这样我就不用为每一个单独的修改去等提示词结果了。
That's how I don't have to wait for each prompt for each individual one.

1274
01:53:15,342 --> 01:53:17,700
这能加快我的工作流。
So that can speed up my workflow.

1275
01:53:17,998 --> 01:53:26,592
具体来说，让玩家在购买并放置对象或胶状生物时，不要自动开火。
So specifically, make it so that when the player buys something and then
they place on the object or the blob, they don't automatically fire.

1276
01:53:26,894 --> 01:53:29,124
也就是说，他们在放置对象时不应该开火。
So they should not fire when they're placing down an object.

1277
01:53:29,552 --> 01:53:34,532
另外，在玩家放置友好粘液时增加一个全息图。
Also add a hologram for when the player is placing the friendly blob.

1278
01:53:35,726 --> 01:53:40,484
与其把那个射掉，我们可以看看我的游戏还有哪些其他改进点。
