我还想让你创建一个叫 Alpha 粘液的新敌人，它和其他的胶状生物一起生成，但它不是去攻击塔，
而是去追逐玩家角色并在角色身边爆炸造成伤害。
I also want you to create a new enemy called Alpha Blob that spawns with the rest of the blobs, but instead of going after the tower,
that blob will go after the player character and explode next to the character, which will cause damage.

1289
01:54:37,312 --> 01:54:41,552
所以角色必须同时担心自己的生命值和塔的生命值。
So the character has to worry about their own health and the tower's health.

1290
