1301
01:55:09,792 --> 01:55:11,712
好的，我现在抓到它了。
Okay, I now caught it.

1302
01:55:11,872 --> 01:55:17,668
所以现在我们有一个 Alpha 粘液，它就在追逐我这个玩家并试图摧毁我。
So we now have an alpha blob that's just chasing me the player and trying to destroy me.

1303
01:55:18,350 --> 01:55:21,024
到这一步，我只是在做非常小的润色。
At this point, I'm just doing a very small polish pass.

1304
01:55:21,518 --> 01:55:28,624
这就是关于 AI 的一个误区，就是人们认为，哦，你只要用 AI 生成一次游戏就搞定了。
And this is the misconception with AI, is that people think that, oh, you just generate the game once with AI and that's it.

1305
01:55:28,864 --> 01:55:39,744
当然，你也可以那样做，或者像我在视频里展示的那样，你可以通过一个个提示词，
慢慢地一个功能一个功能地构建你的游戏，然后完善游戏的每一个元素。
Well, you could do that, or like what I showed in this video, you can build up your game
feature by feature, prompt by prompt slowly, and then refine each element of your game.

1306
01:55:40,014 --> 01:55:43,664
所以仅仅因为是 AI 生成的，并不意味着你不能去修改它。
So just because the AI generated it doesn't mean you can't change it.

1307
01:55:43,822 --> 01:55:44,624
它全都是代码。
It's all code.

1308
01:55:44,704 --> 01:55:45,824
你可以修改一切。
You can change everything.

1309
01:55:46,158 --> 01:55:51,716
所以如果你不喜欢某些地方，你可以进去优化它，然后继续添加功能，一个接一个地添加。
So if you don't like something, you could go in, polish it, and then just keep on adding feature and feature.

